          "describe": "Neural Drive unlocks the γ partition, initial γ computing power: <color=#F74848>4</color>\n\nAt computing power <color=#F74848>1</color>:\n· When initiating combat, if a Critical hit occurs, uses the opposite arm to launch a [Flurry Strike], dealing <color=#F74848>0.5</color>x DMG.\nAt computing power <color=#F74848>4</color>:\n· AP Cap <color=#F74848>+1</color>.\nAt computing power <color=#F74848>7</color>:\n· [Re-ATK] or [Re-Act]'s effective times per turn <color=#F74848>+1</color>.\nAt computing power <color=#F74848>10</color>:\n· When initiating combat, if second weapon [Type] is used, increases DMG dealt by <color=#F74848>20%</color> for that weapon.\nAt computing power <color=#F74848>13</color>:\n· When attacked by Melee or Assault weapons, DMG taken is reduced by <color=#F74848>20%</color> and Critical Hit DMG taken is reduced by <color=#F74848>15%</color>.\nAt computing power <color=#F74848>16</color>:\n· The [Flurry Strike] multiplier of [Gun Heart, Blade Soul 1] effect increases to <color=#F74848>1</color>x.\n",
